! Radial grid for the flagship cascade: CZTR's density map (5 cells per H_p,
! 30 km floor; tools/grid/grid_mod.f90) with radial cells no taller than the
! horizontal spacing at 0.15 deg (aspect 1). 196 cells to the photosphere
! (114 below 0.96 R, 138 below 0.99 R); deep cells 1.3-1.6 Mm.
! make data/static_init_015a1.dat -> data/grid_015a1.dat, data/static_init_015a1.dat
! The base at P = 5.89e13, the static envelope's convection-zone base
! (0.7115 R): the default 6e13 (CZTR's grid) lies ~1 Mm deeper, in a thin
! radiative layer; a cell there (1.3 Mm cells) gives the 4th-order face
! derivative of s0 a spurious superadiabatic overshoot at face 2 and a
! +-4 Lsun MLT / numerical diffusion pair (output_studio/c197_m0).
&grid
  p_base = 5.89e13
  horiz_deg = 0.15, aspect = 1.0
/
